.TH FREMOVEXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fremovexattr \- removes an extended attribute from an open file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B int fremovexattr(int descriptor, const char* name);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes an extended attribute from an open file.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fremovexattr (2)
